--- !u!114 &1686516358
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1686516354}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ff1eae7fb5c09f94291852f8299d9cf8, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Notes: "-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nThe
    runtime manager is always active in the game.\nIt and its children do not get
    destroyed during scene switches.\n\nThe runtime manager (and its children) handle
    main runtime of the game. \nIt is not a game manager, however:\n\nIt commands
    game managers when to execute, pause or other.\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nThe
    runtime manager finds and inits:\n\nIO Manager\nAppSettingsManager\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nIO
    Manager:\n\nThe IO Manager is the component, which imports and exports information
    to text files. (e.g. settings, preferences, etc.)\n\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAppSettingsManager\n\nThe
    AppSettingsManager \n\n\n\n\n"
